# HARTHMERE_IMAGE_ASSET_TRIM (2026-08-04 asset loading audit, finding 12)
#
# Upstream Biomes marketing media: 344 MB of trailer and hero video that no
# module under src/ references. Verified by
# src/client/test/image_asset_trim.test.ts, which fails if any of these paths
# becomes reachable from the application again.
#
#   trailer-4k.mp4   134.8 MB     hero-video.mov  66.8 MB (a ProRes-era source
#   trailer-4k.webm   84.3 MB     hero-video.mp4  58.9 MB  next to its own
#                                                           export)
#
# They were copied into every production image (Dockerfile.biomes, the
# `COPY public/splash/` layer), so they were paid for on every image pull and
# every container start, and they inflated the context of every `docker build`.
# The files stay in the repository; they are simply not shipped in the runtime
# image.
#
# The referenced splash assets -- home-bg.png, biomes-logo.png, b-logo.png,
# biomes.svg, black.png, trailer-poster.png, 404.png, hero-bg*.png and the rest
# -- are NOT excluded and must not be.
public/splash/trailer-4k.mp4
public/splash/trailer-4k.webm
public/splash/hero-video.mov
public/splash/hero-video.mp4
